-- aar/w3/aar_row_608_draft3.sql. DRAFT 3 by W3 (session_01H1X3ANsGiMnhnbkfphocmo) for the coordinator (seat 36). NOT RUN by W3. Draft 2 04a2a022: W1 PASS (Wall 11713), pressed "Add it" by the operator at 15:03 CST 2026-11-24 (ruling row 544), NOT inserted (the coordinator's insert was refused).
-- ONE CHANGE from draft 2, a defect of mine found after row 173 (ASK 623) failed ask_aar_grades_check(): md5_written holds 1ba39c5f (the engine target as written), and grades named only 76630422 (the target as graded, before W1's N1), so the check would read ok false. grades gains one element for 1ba39c5f: W1's readback (Wall 11703), which found the live engine equal to target_engine_608.json 1ba39c5f and that target different from the graded 76630422 only in N1. Wall 11766 and 11767 join the sources.
