-- Wall 11658 to 11661, 11694, 11695, 11697, 11698, 11700: W3 read the first 900 characters of each. Wall 11702, 11703 read in full. Wall 11704 is W3's own post. Wall 11707 read in full by W3.
-- Audit ids 41642 (engine write) and 41648 (manual write) read by W3 from audit_log (id, title, first 160 characters).
-- objective_met is 'in part': written and read back; the manual entry written and read back (Wall 11707); UNEXERCISED by a run (glm has never enforced; the two-live-runs rule applies).
